title: The investiture debate
new-page: true
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-inv-count', 'sanchez');
}
!}

= The investiture debate

The King has proposed you as candidate. Before you set the date, you can still change the arithmetic. This is the projected vote today:

{!<div id="sp-inv-count"></div>!}

You need 176 yes votes in the first ballot, or more yes than no votes in the second.

- @sign_cs: Sign a government agreement with Ciudadanos
- @sign_up: Sign a government agreement with Podemos
- @referendum: Offer the Catalan parties talks on their demands
- @debate: Go to the debate
- @root: Not yet: keep negotiating

@sign_cs
title: Sign a government agreement with Ciudadanos
subtitle: Ciudadanos will vote yes; Podemos will vote no.
choose-if: cs_talks >= 2 and pact_cs = 0 and pact_up = 0 and cs_veto_sanchez = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cs_veto_sanchez = 1 : Albert Rivera has ruled out any agreement with Pedro Sánchez. ?][? if pact_up = 1 : Ciudadanos will not join an agreement that includes Podemos. ?][? if pact_up = 0 and cs_talks < 2 and cs_veto_sanchez = 0 : The talks with Ciudadanos are not far enough advanced. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.pact_cs = 1; Q.rel_cs += 10; Q.rel_up -= 15; Q.modernisers_dissent -= 5; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; Q.progressives_dissent += 10; Q.trade_unionists_dissent += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'psoe', 'up', {workers: 1.5, students: 1.5, unemployed: 1}); window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: 1.5, self_employed: 0.5}); } !}
go-to: sp_investiture

@sign_up
title: Sign a government agreement with Podemos
subtitle: Podemos will vote yes; Ciudadanos will vote no.
choose-if: up_talks >= 2 and pact_up = 0 and pact_cs = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if pact_cs = 1 : Podemos will not support a government built on a deal with Ciudadanos. ?][? if pact_cs = 0 and up_talks < 2 : The talks with Podemos are not far enough advanced. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.pact_up = 1; Q.rel_up += 10; Q.rel_cs -= 15; Q.progressives_dissent -= 10; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 12 + 8 * (Q.barons_veto || 0); Q.institutionalists_dissent += 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'psoe', {cs: 0.6, pp: 0.4}, {pensioners: 1.5, self_employed: 1.5, homemakers: 1}); window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'up', 'psoe', {workers: 1.5, unemployed: 1}); } !}
go-to: share_posts

@share_posts
title: The share of the government
new-page: true

= The share of the government

The programme is agreed, but Podemos will not vote for you until it knows what it gets: how many ministries, and whether [? if year < 2018 : Pablo Iglesias ?][? if year >= 2018 : its leader ?] is Deputy Prime Minister. The names can wait until after the vote; the share cannot. In July 2019 exactly this question sank an investiture.

- @share_standard: A Deputy Prime Minister and ministries in proportion to seats
- @share_generous: Their terms: a Deputy Prime Minister and two more ministries
- @share_hard: Ministries, but no Deputy Prime Minister and nothing economic

@share_standard
title: In proportion
on-arrival: {! Q.cab_share = 'standard'; Q.cab_share_set = 1; !}
go-to: sp_investiture

@share_generous
title: Their terms
on-arrival: {! Q.cab_share = 'generous'; Q.cab_share_set = 1; Q.rel_up += 8; Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 6; Q.institutionalists_dissent += 4; !}

Podemos is delighted. The barons ask how a party with fewer seats ends up with a vice-presidency and the ministries it wanted.

- @root: Continue

@share_hard
title: A hard bargain
on-arrival: {! Q.cab_share = 'hard'; Q.cab_share_set = 1; Q.share_walkout = (Math.random() * 100 > 20 + (Q.rel_up || 40) / 2) ? 1 : 0; if (Q.share_walkout) { Q.pact_up = 0; Q.rel_up -= 15; Q.cab_share = ''; Q.cab_share_set = 0; } else { Q.rel_up -= 8; Q.sanchez_authority += 3; } !}

[? if share_walkout = 1 : Podemos calls it humiliating and breaks off the talks. Its deputies will not vote for you. The agreement is dead; you will have to start again. ?][? if share_walkout = 0 : Podemos accepts through gritted teeth. You keep every lever of economic power. ?]

@referendum
title: Offer the Catalan parties talks on their demands
subtitle: Could turn ERC and Convergència's votes into abstentions.
view-if: pact_cs = 0 and referendum_offer = 0
on-arrival: {! Q.referendum_offer = 1; Q.rel_erc += 15; Q.rel_junts += 15; if (Q.red_lines) { Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 25; Q.federal_committee_balance -= 12; Q.sanchez_authority -= 6; } else { Q.regional_leaders_dissent += 10; } if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transfer(Q, 'psoe', {pp: 0.5, cs: 0.5}, {pensioners: 2, homemakers: 1.5, self_employed: 1}); window.SpainGame.regionalMod(Q, 'Cataluña', 'psoe', 1.05); } !}
go-to: sp_investiture

[? if red_lines = 1 : You have broken the Federal Committee's resolution. The barons are openly discussing your removal. ?][? if red_lines = 0 : The barons are furious, but the Federal Committee never bound you. ?]

@debate
title: The debate

= The debate

Two days of speeches. What do you build your speech around?

- @speech_change: A government of change
- @speech_reform: A reformist government for all Spaniards
- @speech_attack: The case against [+ pp_leader_short +]

@speech_change
on-arrival: rel_up += 3; rel_cs -= 2; member_morale += 3
go-to: vote

@speech_reform
on-arrival: rel_cs += 3; rel_pnv += 2; rel_up -= 2
go-to: vote

@speech_attack
on-arrival: rel_pp -= 8; member_morale += 4
go-to: vote

@vote
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.holdInvestiture(Q, 'sanchez');
}
!}
go-to: won if inv_passes = 1; lost if inv_passes = 0

@won
title: Prime Minister
on-arrival: sanchez_authority += 15; member_morale += 10; sanchismo += 10; federal_committee_balance += 8; sanchez_nominated = 0

= Prime Minister

{!<div class="sp-last-vote"></div>!}

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. Pedro Sánchez is invested President of the Government.

@lost
title: Defeated
on-arrival: {!
Q.sanchez_nominated = 0;
if (Q.inv_yes >= 130) { Q.sanchez_authority += 2; } else { Q.sanchez_authority -= 6; }
!}

= Defeated

{!<div class="sp-last-vote"></div>!}

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. The chamber rejects your candidacy in both ballots.

[? if investiture_clock > 0 : The two-month clock has started: eight weeks. If no one is invested before it runs out, the Cortes will be dissolved. ?]
